(text "Source: https://nicekeyboards.com/docs/nice-nano/pinout-schematic (pinout-v2.png,\n  fetched 2026-11-05).\nPin names and Dn (Arduino label) copied from that image. Our pin numbers 1-26 are not on\n  the image.\nBATTERY+ appears twice on the front, as on the image.\nBack pads SWC, SWD, P1.01, P1.02, P1.07, BOOST are named as on the image; pad positions\n  here are approximate." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.000 156.960 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f86fe944-2238-595d-a85d-2211a839eefe"))
